Description: GNOME Bluetooth hands-free integration for mobile phones
 GNOME Handy connects a paired phone to GNOME over Bluetooth HFP. It provides
 a GNOME Shell extension and a Rust service for call controls, audio routing,
 ringtone playback, tel: URI handling, and optional SMS notifications through
 Bluetooth MAP.
